{"job_id":"F-7adfd2c8649ef12fb49e","family_id":"F-7adfd2c8649ef12fb49e","title":"육군공병학교령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010287-273549-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":7,"target_id":"1a87cad774285c0626564b6d3beecd09f934c51e6bb4a02011a0ef9b6881d241","source_hash":"786e35adccbc3ae8aff01103f97ee51bee54b7f807598129eb8c21f994eabbcc","text":"陆军工程学校规章"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010287-273549-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":98,"target_id":"105a2682e497158aa4cd97c1763dfbae64348f611e4c3c3df9668b763be5386b","source_hash":"57df6debca780004572b2200c891dc75f7b18ffdd442fdbc139ad94df4f0d939","text":"第一条（设施和任务）\n①在陆军中建立一所陆军工程学校。\n陆军工程兵学校研究和发展工程兵种的战术和理论，并通过对军官和士兵的教育培养专业人才。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010287-273549-ko","scope":"BODY","start":98,"end":264,"target_id":"c0657cbd0e03f36fc4608e27bfe9d5738f4d7e702fac8c9a495fb3a8167d4fed","source_hash":"7ee3f3f94873a6cad6b4c079e07db19e4ad6335fe2a12ff0c9ed8aff361045be","text":"第二条（主要）\n①陆军工程兵学校应任命一名校长。\n②校长应从陆军将官或二级及以上文职人员中任命。<2025年9月2日修订>\n③ 学校校长奉陆军参谋长之命，负责学校事务，并指挥和监督附属部门和单位。<2017年11月14日修订>\n④ 删除 <2017.11.14>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010287-273549-ko","scope":"BODY","start":264,"end":418,"target_id":"ce13a2a58dfa37a7e6877d7af1e1dc2a468b553e1f6f8c5c9497d4e7ba7aaf0d","source_hash":"5411437b04f8f25bdaae899b10f37f6575fe0a2706416124e312f1fe7971f006","text":"第三条（部门和单位的设立）\n①陆军工程兵学校应设有必要的系科和单位。<2017年11月14日修订>\n② 第1款规定的部门设立和职责划分事宜，由陆军参谋长决定；部队的设立、任务和组织事宜，由国防部长决定。<2017年11月14日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010287-273549-ko","scope":"BODY","start":418,"end":480,"target_id":"ac253d2ed87969fe3b2565d66584bce0432f44191cd873a865ba2cd98c715069","source_hash":"05710ae51d2ff19066211a7885bdf93ddaf2e59d53f92654d36f4fbfba7d44ef","text":"第四条（课程等）陆军工程学校的课程、课时以及其他有关运作的事项，由陆军参谋长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010287-273549-ko","scope":"BODY","start":480,"end":526,"target_id":"fdce6a16e4c54744193759038b0503c9e1530cf3c19febf592b6adb26a3c9cc1","source_hash":"36ef4b3983737a04fa60137746f4d0cb47d5854fbcf6e1dccf94a12f23bd5be2","text":"第五条（人员配额）驻扎在陆军工程兵学校的军事人员和文职人员的人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010287-273549-ko","scope":"BODY","start":526,"end":570,"target_id":"0505917bac8df654316fcc894dbd35763aae349a95cb025192b6370f665f8218","source_hash":"a91bbe4bf33f4a9fbf93e0a9a8ded451157114378990a00bd0d9656a474c797f","text":"补充规定 <第19680号，2006年9月22日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010287-273549-ko","scope":"BODY","start":570,"end":603,"target_id":"d1497b7374b4f7c2fb49ebc7eccbb9859924e07c385737edefd8d4ae247c0249","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充规定（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010287-273549-ko","scope":"BODY","start":603,"end":640,"target_id":"85f2ec1612260628bb9060c89b7b388f6fef80515ccfe8e407ceb91b214d023a","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010287-273549-ko","scope":"BODY","start":640,"end":654,"target_id":"816bf2ccdc9784baa6ebe6df3557d148c35df710310e17081844aca6b72a901e","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"条款 2 和 3 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010287-273549-ko","scope":"BODY","start":654,"end":773,"target_id":"8cc5fc20aa31cef135d72d6a9183be221c00e7e3e82654cb129cebe9504a17af","source_hash":"337180b1bb66d82cfdb73eafab7d5cd4488be8e3d49e0a63abd2074e1695ac9a","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<55>款已省略\n\n  <56> 陆军工程学校规章部分修订如下。\n\n  第 2 条第 2 款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n  <57> 至 <90> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010287-273549-ko","scope":"BODY","start":773,"end":818,"target_id":"605c3054477567043db01fc54bb0761098e3f65f73c698f4ed9772d0c891c14c","source_hash":"47bc4491cb152fb54093581b62b35c2f932e23131ec4742a8c6018aaf5832801","text":"补充规定 <2017年11月14日第28431号>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010287-273549-ko","scope":"BODY","start":818,"end":902,"target_id":"e7da26e3c9faabe798bb53ee2a8a5fdbff3eb0fa514e8a2517654730da63e878","source_hash":"12fb47a24a8a8d48c76b328876ef72f13041b533e51fcc7761110c3332d77371","text":"增补（关于部分修改九项法令以提高军事组织运作效率的总统令）<第35726号，2025年9月2日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。"}]}